From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: keep Home surface focusable for Sugar shortcuts

The Home Gtk.Box must remain on the focus path when child views or search
entries are selected so F1-F6 reach semantic Sugar handling.

--- a/src/jarabe/desktop/homewindow.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/desktop/homewindow.py
@@ -53,3 +53,4 @@
         super().__init__(orientation=Gtk.Orientation.VERTICAL)
+        self.set_focusable(True)
         self.add_css_class('home-window')
